  "description": "(3.2.0) Cloud-backed implementations of CircleAI.Speech contracts — OpenAI Whisper ISpeechRecognizer + OpenAI TTS ISpeechSynthesizer (response_format=pcm so the result satisfies the PCM-16 mono contract). Plus a generic regex-based IVoiceIntentRouter (lifted from CircleUp's KeywordVoiceCommandRouter, vault-specific patterns stripped — consumer supplies intent definitions). Gives every CircleAI consumer a working voice loop today, until the on-device FunASR / ChatTTS backends ship in 2.3.1.",
